orld Cup tournaments and 7 European Championships."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1407, "end": 1527, "text": "The team has also won several notable titles, including the 1948 Olympic gold medal and the 1958 World Cup bronze medal."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1528, "end": 1731, "text": "\"Sweden's national team has a strong reputation in European football, and their rivalry with Norway is one of the most intense and closely watched in the region,\" said UEFA President, Aleksander Čeferin."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1732, "end": 1880, "text": "\"The team's participation in the Norway v Sweden rivalry is a testament to their commitment to excellence and their passion for the beautiful game.\""}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1881, "end": 2004, "text": "In terms of statistics, Sweden has a slight edge over Norway in their head-to-head encounters, with 54 wins to Norway's 25."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2005, "end": 2125, "text": "However, Norway has been closing the gap in recent years, with several notable victories over their Scandinavian rivals."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2126, "end": 2244, "text": "\"Sweden is a team that always pushes us to be our best,\" said Norway's current national team captain, Stefan Johansen."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2245, "end": 2367, "text": "\"We have a lot of respect for them, and we know that every time we face them, it's going to be a tough and intense match.\""}}, "candidates": [{"candidate_id": "C0", "answer": "UEFA Euro 1968 qualifying match", "card_ids": ["d1:c0", "d2:c0"]}], "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d1", "card_id": "d1:c0", "entity": "Norway v Sweden", "scope": "participating team", "claim": "Norway v Sweden is a participating team from the UEFA Euro 1968 qualifying match.", "answer": "UEFA Euro 1968 qualify